---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ShareButtons from '../../../components/ShareButtons.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Jev-Mem: Your Agent's Brain Has Two Systems Now | Demystifying AI in 5 Minutes"
  description="Jev-Mem splits agentic memory into a fast System-One controller and a deliberative System-Two reasoner. 6.6x faster construction, 36.7% lower query latency, 11% better answers on LoCoMo."
  image="/og-series-ep35-jev-mem.png"
  keywords="Jev-Mem, agentic memory, System One, System Two, dual process, agent memory, LoCoMo, TypeSafe AI, memory graph, retrieval"
  publishedDate="2026-09-27"
  articleSection="Demystifying AI"
  articleTags={["Jev-Mem", "Agentic Memory", "System One", "System Two", "Dual Process", "Agent Architecture"]}
>

  <style>
    .stat-card {
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    .stat-card:hover {
      transform: scale(1.02);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
    }
    .arch-card {
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    .arch-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08);
    }
    .code-block {
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    .code-block:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06);
    }
  </style>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-border">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-violet-500/[0.04] via-background to-background"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,rgba(139,92,246,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div>

    <div class="relative container-main max-w-4xl pt-20 pb-10">
      <a href="/series/demystifying-ai" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-secondary hover:text-violet-400 transition-colors mb-8 font-mono">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"/></svg>
        cd ~/series/demystifying-ai
      </a>

      <!-- Hero Image -->
      <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-border mb-8">
        <img src="/series/ep35-jev-mem.png" alt="Jev-Mem - Your Agent's Brain Has Two Systems Now" class="w-full h-auto block" />
      </div>

      <!-- Meta -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 md:gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] text-violet-400 font-mono bg-violet-500/5 border border-violet-500/20 px-2 py-1 rounded-full">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          EP 35
        </span>
        <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.23986" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-mono bg-violet-500/10 border border-violet-500/20 text-violet-400 rounded-full hover:bg-violet-500/20 hover:border-violet-500/40 transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2" /><path d="M9 7l3 5-3 5M15 7l-3 5 3 5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          arXiv: 2609.23986
          <svg class="w-2.5 h-2.5 opacity-60" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
        </a>
        <span class="text-[10px] text-secondary font-mono">Sep 27, 2026</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] text-secondary font-mono">5 min</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-foreground leading-tight mb-3">
        Jev-Mem: Your Agent's Brain Has Two Systems Now
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-secondary max-w-2xl mb-2">
        Every agent memory system calls the LLM for housekeeping. Jev-Mem says: stop that. A fast System-One controller handles typing, routing, scoring, and stopping. The big model only shows up when it is time to think.
      </p>

      <ShareButtons title="Jev-Mem: Your Agent's Brain Has Two Systems Now" url="/series/demystifying-ai/jev-mem" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Article Body -->
  <article class="container-main max-w-4xl py-10">

    <!-- TL;DR -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-green/20 bg-green/[0.03] p-6 mb-10 max-w-3xl">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-green font-bold">// TL;DR</span>
      <p class="text-sm text-foreground/90 leading-relaxed mt-3 mb-0">
        Jev-Mem splits agent memory into a <strong>lightweight System-One controller</strong> for all fast decisions and a <strong>System-Two LLM</strong> that only handles final reasoning. Result: <strong>6.6x faster memory construction</strong>, <strong>36.7% lower query latency</strong>, and <strong>11% better answers</strong> on LoCoMo. Open-source.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 1: The Problem -->
    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="text-violet-400 font-mono text-sm">#</span> The Problem: Your Agent's Memory Is Expensive
    </h2>

    <p class="text-sm text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-3xl">
      Current agent memory systems (MemGPT, A-Mem, ReadAgent) use the full LLM for everything. Typing a new memory? LLM call. Deciding which store to query? LLM call. Checking if retrieval found enough evidence? Another LLM call.
    </p>

    <p class="text-sm text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-3xl">
      <strong>The LLM is on the critical path of every memory operation.</strong> That means every read and every write pays the cost of autoregressive generation, even when the decision is "this is a temporal observation" or "stop searching."
    </p>

    <!-- Problem visual: cost comparison -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-10 max-w-3xl">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-red-500/20 bg-red-500/[0.03] p-5 arch-card">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="text-red-400 text-lg">&#x26A0;</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-red-400 font-bold">TRADITIONAL AGENT MEMORY</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="text-xs text-foreground/70 space-y-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5">x</span>
            <span>LLM called for <strong>every</strong> memory write</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5">x</span>
            <span>LLM called for <strong>every</strong> retrieval decision</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5">x</span>
            <span>Fixed top-k search, no adaptive stopping</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5">x</span>
            <span>1,042s memory construction (A-Mem)</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-violet-500/20 bg-violet-500/[0.03] p-5 arch-card">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="text-violet-400 text-lg">&#x2714;</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-violet-400 font-bold">JEV-MEM</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="text-xs text-foreground/70 space-y-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-violet-400 mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
            <span>System One handles writes <strong>without LLM</strong></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-violet-400 mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
            <span>System One handles routing, scoring, stopping</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-violet-400 mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
            <span>Evidence-guided adaptive stopping</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-violet-400 mt-0.5">&#x2713;</span>
            <span><strong>158s</strong> memory construction (6.6x faster)</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 2: Architecture -->
    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="text-violet-400 font-mono text-sm">#</span> Three Planes, One Memory
    </h2>

    <p class="text-sm text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-3xl">
      Jev-Mem is built on the dual-process model from cognitive science. System One is fast, cheap, and handles bounded decisions. System Two is slow, expensive, and handles open-ended reasoning. The key insight: <strong>most memory operations are System-One decisions</strong>.
    </p>

    <!-- Architecture diagram -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-elevated p-6 mb-10 max-w-3xl">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-secondary mb-4 text-center">ARCHITECTURE</div>

      <!-- System One -->
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-violet-500/30 bg-violet-500/[0.05] p-4 mb-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-400"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-violet-400 font-bold">SYSTEM ONE - CONTROL PLANE</span>
          <span class="ml-auto text-[10px] font-mono text-violet-400/60">fast, lightweight, no generation</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-2">
          <div class="rounded bg-violet-500/10 px-2 py-1.5 text-center">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-foreground/70">Memory Typing</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded bg-violet-500/10 px-2 py-1.5 text-center">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-foreground/70">Query Routing</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded bg-violet-500/10 px-2 py-1.5 text-center">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-foreground/70">Candidate Scoring</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded bg-violet-500/10 px-2 py-1.5 text-center">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-foreground/70">Adaptive Stop</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Memory Plane -->
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-green/30 bg-green/[0.05] p-4 mb-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-green font-bold">MEMORY DATA PLANE</span>
          <span class="ml-auto text-[10px] font-mono text-green/60">structured multi-relational graph</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-2">
          <div class="rounded bg-green/10 px-2 py-1.5 text-center">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-foreground/70">Semantic</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded bg-green/10 px-2 py-1.5 text-center">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-foreground/70">Temporal</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded bg-green/10 px-2 py-1.5 text-center">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-foreground/70">Causal</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded bg-green/10 px-2 py-1.5 text-center">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-foreground/70">Entity</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- System Two -->
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-cyan/30 bg-cyan/[0.05] p-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan font-bold">SYSTEM TWO - REASONING PLANE</span>
          <span class="ml-auto text-[10px] font-mono text-cyan/60">expensive, deliberative, LLM</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <div class="rounded bg-cyan/10 px-2 py-1.5 text-center">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-foreground/70">Complex Reasoning</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded bg-cyan/10 px-2 py-1.5 text-center">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-foreground/70">Answer Synthesis</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Flow arrows -->
      <div class="flex justify-center mt-4">
        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-secondary">Query &#8594; System One routes &#8594; Memory retrieves &#8594; System One scores/stops &#8594; System Two synthesizes</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 3: Write Path -->
    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="text-violet-400 font-mono text-sm">#</span> Write Path: 158 Seconds for the Whole Graph
    </h2>

    <p class="text-sm text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-3xl">
      When a new observation arrives, System One handles everything. No LLM calls.
    </p>

    <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-elevated p-5 mb-10 max-w-3xl code-block">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-secondary mb-3">WRITE PIPELINE</div>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-violet-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-mono text-violet-400 font-bold">1</span>
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground">Typing</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-foreground/60 mt-0.5">System One classifies: factual, temporal, emotional, behavioral, preference, or relationship</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-violet-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-mono text-violet-400 font-bold">2</span>
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground">Redundancy filter</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-foreground/60 mt-0.5">Checks if this observation is already stored. If redundant, skip.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-violet-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-mono text-violet-400 font-bold">3</span>
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground">Relational linking</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-foreground/60 mt-0.5">Builds 4 edge types: semantic (embedding similarity), temporal (time proximity), causal (cause-effect), entity (shared entities)</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-green/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-mono text-green font-bold">4</span>
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground">Store</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-foreground/60 mt-0.5">Canonical observation + edges committed to the memory graph</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 4: Read Path -->
    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="text-violet-400 font-mono text-sm">#</span> Read Path: Closed-Loop Retrieval
    </h2>

    <p class="text-sm text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-3xl">
      This is where Jev-Mem really separates itself. Retrieval is not a one-shot top-k search. It is a <strong>closed-loop control process</strong> where System One continuously decides what to do next.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6 max-w-3xl">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-violet-500/20 bg-violet-500/[0.03] p-4 arch-card">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-violet-400 font-bold block mb-2">QUERY ROUTING</span>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-foreground/70 mb-2">System One predicts relevance probability for each relation view:</p>
        <div class="space-y-1.5">
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] font-mono">
            <span class="text-foreground/60">Semantic</span>
            <span class="text-violet-400">p = 0.92</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] font-mono">
            <span class="text-foreground/60">Temporal</span>
            <span class="text-violet-400">p = 0.71</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] font-mono">
            <span class="text-foreground/60">Causal</span>
            <span class="text-violet-400">p = 0.45</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] font-mono">
            <span class="text-foreground/60">Entity</span>
            <span class="text-foreground/30">p = 0.08 (skip)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[10px] text-foreground/50 mt-2">Threshold: 0.10. Multiple views activate simultaneously.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-violet-500/20 bg-violet-500/[0.03] p-4 arch-card">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-violet-400 font-bold block mb-2">ADAPTIVE STOPPING</span>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-foreground/70 mb-2">After each retrieval round, System One evaluates:</p>
        <div class="space-y-1.5">
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] font-mono">
            <span class="text-foreground/60">evidence_sufficient</span>
            <span class="text-green">&#8805; 0.95 = stop</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] font-mono">
            <span class="text-foreground/60">continue_useful</span>
            <span class="text-red-400">&lt; 0.15 = stop</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] font-mono">
            <span class="text-foreground/60">missing_evidence</span>
            <span class="text-green">&lt; 0.15 = ok</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] font-mono">
            <span class="text-foreground/60">contradiction</span>
            <span class="text-green">&lt; 0.15 = ok</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[10px] text-foreground/50 mt-2">Dual-condition: "enough evidence" OR "not worth searching more."</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-sm text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-3xl">
      The beam search uses <strong>width 10</strong>, an <strong>expansion budget of 80</strong>, and a <strong>depth limit of 8</strong>. Each step combines System One's relevance scores with embedding similarity, stored edge weights, and recency adjustments. When evidence is sufficient or the expected value of continuing is too low, retrieval stops early. No wasted tokens.
    </p>

    <!-- Section 5: Numbers -->
    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="text-violet-400 font-mono text-sm">#</span> The Numbers
    </h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6 max-w-3xl">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-violet-500/20 bg-violet-500/[0.03] p-5 text-center stat-card">
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-violet-400 mb-1">0.777</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-secondary">LLM-as-Judge Score</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-foreground/50 mt-1">+11.0% vs strongest baseline</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-violet-500/20 bg-violet-500/[0.03] p-5 text-center stat-card">
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-violet-400 mb-1">158s</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-secondary">Memory Construction</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-foreground/50 mt-1">6.6x faster than fastest baseline</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-violet-500/20 bg-violet-500/[0.03] p-5 text-center stat-card">
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-violet-400 mb-1">0.93s</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-secondary">Avg Query Latency</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-foreground/50 mt-1">36.7% reduction</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison table - desktop -->
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border mb-10 max-w-3xl hidden md:block">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="bg-elevated">
            <th class="text-left text-[10px] font-mono text-secondary px-4 py-2.5">System</th>
            <th class="text-center text-[10px] font-mono text-secondary px-4 py-2.5">Judge Score</th>
            <th class="text-center text-[10px] font-mono text-secondary px-4 py-2.5">Build Time (s)</th>
            <th class="text-center text-[10px] font-mono text-secondary px-4 py-2.5">Query Latency (s)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-border">
          <tr class="bg-violet-500/[0.03]">
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-violet-400">Jev-Mem</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-center font-bold text-violet-400">0.777</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-center font-bold text-violet-400">158</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-center font-bold text-violet-400">0.93</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-foreground/70">A-Mem</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-center text-foreground/70">0.700</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-center text-foreground/70">1,042</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-center text-foreground/70">1.47</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-foreground/70">MemGPT</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-center text-foreground/70">0.649</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-center text-foreground/70">892</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-center text-foreground/70">2.31</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-foreground/70">ReadAgent</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-center text-foreground/70">0.623</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-center text-foreground/70">1,271</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-center text-foreground/70">1.89</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison table - mobile -->
    <div class="md:hidden space-y-3 mb-10 max-w-3xl">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-violet-500/20 bg-violet-500/[0.03] p-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-violet-400 font-bold">Jev-Mem</span>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 mt-2">
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-violet-400">0.777</div>
            <div class="text-[9px] text-secondary">Score</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-violet-400">158s</div>
            <div class="text-[9px] text-secondary">Build</div>
          </div>
